    "Name": "UrbanMech UM-SNK",
    "Details": "While the chassis of this <i>UrbanMech</i> may be a stock -R60 from the now-destroyed Orgus Industries factories, almost nothing of the original loadout remains. Two Snub-Nose PPCs occupy the weapon mount previously housing the AC/10, and a Chameleon LPS system has been installed. Eleven double heat sinks keep the 'Mech barely cool.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: 360° Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
